      "duplicate_same_question_same_perspective": false
    }
  },
  "classification_rule": "Classify actual affected semantics. A fixture, metadata or golden change affecting expected economic meaning, scoring, admission or historical interpretation is CRITICAL, irrespective of filename. Unclear affected scope retains strong verification.",
